post-it: Icons don't open
cause: Screenshot set as wallpaper
symptoms:
	Screen looks wrong
	Acts strangely
	Programs won't start
	Something stopped working
	Settings changed
checks:
	yes: Desktop icons don't open
		shows: they are part of the wallpaper; My Computer and the Recycle Bin still work
	yes: Wallpaper is a picture of the desktop
		shows: Display Properties calls it "prank"
	yes: Folder of icons hidden in a corner
		shows: bottom right, mostly off the screen
software steps:
	Open the folder hidden in the corner
	Drag every icon in it onto the desktop
	Change the wallpaper in Display Properties
